@@ -15,6 +15,8 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+- **Call hierarchy keeps nested bodies separate.** Calls inside nested methods, functions, closures and arrow functions no longer appear as direct calls of their enclosing declaration. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
 - **Built-in function suggestions stay consistent after loading.** Completion respects declaration availability before and after sibling lookups, preserves available alternatives and keeps namespace attribute aliases separate. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
 
 - **Project release notes preserve real PHP symbols.** Package removal notes and availability attributes no longer hide project methods, functions, classes or parameters. Explicit version-filtered parsing retains its existing behavior. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
